repository-code: 'https://github.com/nd-nuclear-theory/mfdn-transitions.git'
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  A postprocessing code for wave functions generated in nuclear no-core
  configuration interaction calculations with MFDn.  It may be used to
  evaluate one-body densities or the matrix element of a two-body operator
  between given initial and final states.
references:
  - authors:
